# Form action buttons: right-aligned

Page, form, and modal footers (Back/Cancel, Save draft, Publish, Submit, Create) sit on the **right**.

- Whole group: `flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3` (or `ml-auto` on the group)
- **Cancel/Back first** (leftmost of the group, bordered secondary)
- **Primary last** (rightmost: Save, Publish, Submit, Create)
- Mobile: keep `flex-wrap` so buttons wrap, but the group stays end-aligned
- Do not left-align action rows inside bordered form cards
- Not for list filter Apply/Reset, table row icons, or in-form content actions (e.g. "Add question")

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — left-aligned footer
<div className="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
  <Link href="/admin/surveys">Back</Link>
  <button type="submit">Save draft</button>
  <button type="button">Publish version</button>
</div>

// ✅ GOOD — group on the right; Cancel/Back first, primary last
<div className="flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3">
  <Link href="/admin/surveys">Back</Link>
  <button type="submit">Save draft</button>
  <button type="button">Publish version</button>
</div>
```

See `.cursor/rules/page-navigation.mdc` for Cancel-then-Save order and breadcrumbs.
